(`worktrees.py`), a durable session registry, proactive cached project/session summaries (generate-twice + grounding filter), stage handoffs, runnable deliverable previews (hard-guarded off port 8777), engine toggle (Claudeâ†”Gemini, Gemini research-only), grass-idea board, and per-project cost/tokens/time rollups.\n\n- **Status:** v4 \"Project Cockpit\" is **built (9 waves GREEN, 637 passed) and merged to master**; current branch `foreman/rnd-v4.1-cockpit` is a clean-rebuild refinement to match the Paradigm-2 mockup (compact tile board + inline expanding panels), screenshot-verified.\n\n- **Branding:** Presented as a **Ghost World Labs** tool \"Powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢\" (vendored brand mark, dashboard favicon, Option-B masthead).\n\nThese claims are grounded in the project's `CLAUDE.md`, the locked North Star / Stage-0 decisions for v3 and v4, and the declared deliverable (`anchor_gui.py`)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45363,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b291187b-46fd-4161-bd0c-14d2721b43f6","uuid":"3872f22c-4627-4ebd-bb00-83ab85ca63ae","request_id":"req_011Cc2Hm63AgZy8xZQQPjPJV"}
